          "id": "S2E1",
          "sourceId": "fc76efe50de5297b",
          "quote": "A Jersey politician said she thought cost-of-living pressures were not considered by the government when it chose to end a trial of free fruit in"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E2",
          "sourceId": "fc76efe50de5297b",
          "quote": "primary schools."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E6",
          "sourceId": "fc76efe50de5297b",
          "quote": "The education minister ended the trial because not enough children were eating the fruit and it was leading to a lot of wastage."
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E7",
          "sourceId": "ce4a0405c2132eb0",
          "quote": "Zelenskyy said that Kyiv was investigating sudden speed restrictions on Ukraine's use of Starshield, the military-grade version of SpaceX's Starlink satellite internet service, which is"
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E8",
          "sourceId": "ce4a0405c2132eb0",
          "quote": "the backbone of Ukraine's drone operations and communication."
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E17",
          "sourceId": "ce4a0405c2132eb0",
          "quote": "The restrictions, imposed without warning early Thursday, cut the internet data connection when a communication terminal moves faster than 160 kph (100 mph)."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E2",
          "sourceId": "94507ba617351e3c",
          "quote": "“Jimmy,” directed by Aaron Burns, chronicles Stewart’s rise in Hollywood and time fighting in WWII."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E3",
          "sourceId": "94507ba617351e3c",
          "quote": "When he returned home from the war, however, Hollywood seemed to have forgotten about him."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E17",
          "sourceId": "94507ba617351e3c",
          "quote": "Stewart considered moving back home to Indiana, Pennsylvania to work in his father’s general store."
        },
        {
          "id": "S1E1",
          "sourceId": "335266f7c6aea4bc",
          "quote": "Police say no further action will be taken against the wife of the government's national security adviser after she posted on social media referencing"
        },
