      "evidence": [
        {
          "id": "S2E1",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "Paul Bettany opened up in a recent interview with The Times about the public’s misconception of his relationship with Johnny Depp after text messages between"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E2",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "the two actors were used in court during Depp’s libel lawsuit against The Sun."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E4",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "“I hadn’t spoken to Johnny in years when that happened and I haven’t spoken to him since."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E10",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "wrote Depp, to which Bettany responded: “Having thought it through I don’t think we should burn Amber – she’s delightful company and easy on the"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E11",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "eye, plus I’m not sure she’s a witch."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E12",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "We could of course try the English course of action in these predicaments ­– we do a drowning test. Thoughts?”"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E13",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "Depp responded that they should “drown her before we burn her!!! I will fuck her burnt corpse afterwards to make sure she’s dead.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E3",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "“So I decided to say nothing because, I think, people know me,” he continued."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E5",
          "sourceId": "b9c6cf1196f850ab",
          "quote": "“I’ve been married 23 years and, for what I do, I live an incredibly quiet life."
        }
      ],
